WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.767
Initial actual CLI PTY frame at 160 by 48. Goal T07.V01 is active.

00:01.767 --> 00:03.567
Key j selects the next Goal: review, pending.

00:03.567 --> 00:05.367
Key k returns selection to Goal T07.V01, active.

00:05.367 --> 00:07.367
Enter collapses the selected Goal detail without changing selection.

00:07.367 --> 00:09.367
The actual model resizes to the minimum supported board, 120 by 32.

00:09.367 --> 00:11.567
At 119 by 31, the only visible model output is: terminal too small; minimum 120×32.

00:11.567 --> 00:16.167
Recovery at 160 by 48 preserves Goal T07.V01 selection and the collapsed detail state.
